# <NAME>

An Even Realities G2 smart-glasses app. Vite + TypeScript + `@evenrealities/even_hub_sdk`, served live at `/<NAME>/` and installable on the phone as a PWA.

Replace this paragraph with a one-sentence description after you know what you're building.

## Put it on the glasses

```bash
npm run qr -- "https://<gpu-host>/<NAME>/"
```

Scan the QR with the Even Realities app. The phone loads this page in its
WebView and the SDK draws on the glasses; edits hot-reload straight onto the
display. No packaging step — `.ehpk` is only for store distribution.

Opened in a plain browser instead, the same URL is just a web app you can
install to the home screen.

## Run

`vite@<NAME>.service` already runs `npm run dev` at boot. To restart manually:

```bash
sudo systemctl restart vite@<NAME>.service
journalctl -u vite@<NAME>.service -f
```
